  throw NumericOverflowError(description: "overflow: out of range")

### Inverse hyperbolic cosine, raw IEEE 754 propagation (`me < 1` -> NaN). Wraps `rf_f32_acosh`.
routine F32.acosh_unchecked() -> F32
